    "legacy": {
      "chapter": 24,
      "location": "飛行岩持續朝惡魔之山方向飛行,途中遭遇鎮守空域的惡魔族守軍;羅德曼(或卡里斯,依前章分支)率隊擊退後,飛行岩的高度突然開始下降,眾人在驚慌中彼此扶持,索爾與亞雷斯分別安撫希莉亞與洛娜,約拿與希爾法則打趣年輕人打情罵俏。",
      "notes": "本章延續 FDTXT_023 分支結局,羅德曼/卡里斯/莎拉何人在場依前章分支而定,以下依 FDTXT_024 原始腳本出現順序全數保留。",
      "source_dat": "FDTXT_024",
      "title": "第二十四章 — 飛行岩迫近惡魔之山,高度驟降"
    }
  },
  "kind": "story",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "空中遭遇惡魔族守軍"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/0/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "啊,無聊得要命..到底還要飛多久啊!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/0/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "真神奇,我們一天內就飛過了大陸西北部..從方向看來,現在應該是在前往邊界的山脈吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 24,
              "speaker_name": "希爾法"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/0/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-24",
          "text": "你是說「惡魔之山」嗎?那一帶全是未熄滅的火山啊!聽說那裡也是惡魔族的根據地..難道惡魔族也和這件事有關?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 16,
              "speaker_name": "凱拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/0/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-16",
          "text": "那倒不奇怪,惡魔族本來就棲息在黑暗和地獄般的炎熱中,和其他種族向不往來,誰曉得它們暗地裡會搞出些什麼!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 3,
              "speaker_name": "哈瓦特"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/0/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-3",
          "text": "瞧,有人來迎接我們了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 16,
              "speaker_name": "凱拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/0/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-16",
          "text": "那..那是什麼?飛行的大岩石,上面有人?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 17,
              "speaker_name": "米亞斯多德"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/0/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-17",
          "text": "笨!那是魔法驅動的飛行裝置,那些人是乘坐在上面的乘客!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 18,
              "speaker_name": "蜜蒂"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/0/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-18",
          "text": "他們想幹什麼?想突破這裡的空域前往火焰之谷嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 19,
              "speaker_name": "羅德曼"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/0/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-19",
          "text": "陛下吩咐過我們,絕不可讓任何人從空中或地下經過此地的!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 16,
              "speaker_name": "凱拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/0/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-16",
          "text": "所以現在我們要宰了那些傢伙!上吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 16,
              "speaker_name": "凱拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/0/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-16",
          "text": "哇!對方來意不善呢!好像想要動手了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/0/lines/11",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "要在這種地方打嗎?好像對我們很不利吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 20,
              "speaker_name": "莎拉"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/0/lines/12",
          "speaker": "character/native-20",
          "text": "我們的伙伴中還有幾個會飛的,勉強可以牽制敵方的攻勢,你們只要在地上確實消滅敵人就可以了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/0/lines/13",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "對方不過是會飛而已,有什麼好怕的!我們先打了再說!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/0/lines/14",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "敵軍似乎是負責鎮守這一帶的空域,以防止他人侵入..看來在惡魔之山一定有什麼事發生,大家要有心理準備,準備面對非常的狀況.."
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/24442d1ead94/scenes/0"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "高度驟降,眾人驚慌"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 24,
              "speaker_name": "希爾法"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-24",
          "text": "約拿老頭,我們的高度好像開始下降了耶!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 20,
              "speaker_name": "莎拉"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/1/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-20",
          "text": "的確,而且越來越快了..."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "哇啊啊啊!索爾,我好怕!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/1/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "希莉亞,抓緊我!悠妮,妳也過來!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 9,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-9",
          "text": "..好!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 5,
              "speaker_name": "洛娜"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/1/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-5",
          "text": ".....!啊,亞雷斯,我頭好昏,..."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/1/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "不要緊吧?來,抓緊我!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 5,
              "speaker_name": "洛娜"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/1/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-5",
          "text": "謝謝..,亞雷斯,你真好.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 24,
              "speaker_name": "希爾法"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/1/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-24",
          "text": "約拿老頭啊,我就說嘛,現在的女孩子要比以前大膽多了,連現在這種狀況都可以拿來作調情的機會,看來我們都落伍嘍!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/24442d1ead94/scenes/1/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "希爾法,如果你不想被她們一腳踹下這飛行岩的話,我建議你在我們著陸前最好保持安靜..."
        }
      ],
